#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:2 046ceaab62394cb4bda55313c59c34ea
msgid "SummarizationHook"
msgstr "摘要钩子"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:4 7c13dd1ceefc4dae8c7544b62fd25d55
msgid "**AI-powered intelligent summarization of long tool outputs**"
msgstr "**基于人工智能的长工具输出智能摘要**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:6 d47cd2563db947829d12df38f2d4069d
msgid ""
"The SummarizationHook automatically summarizes long tool outputs using "
"advanced AI models, preserving key findings and results while reducing "
"length."
msgstr "SummarizationHook 使用先进的人工智能模型自动总结冗长的工具输出，保留关键发现和结果，同时缩减内容长度。"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:9 4dce31d86566457a91f2209b2f2f5bf0
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:11 c3d5d7f38ac34d27aec081b632e251b5
msgid ""
"**What it does:** - Analyzes tool outputs and identifies key information "
"- Uses AI models to create concise summaries - Preserves important "
"technical details and findings - Reduces output length while maintaining "
"relevance"
msgstr ""
"**功能说明：**  \n"
"- 分析工具输出并识别关键信息  \n"
"- 利用人工智能模型生成简明摘要  \n"
"- 保留重要的技术细节和发现  \n"
"- 在保持相关性的前提下缩减输出长度"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:17 c9a150c3cb504b7bb4ff115cf0d0efc7
msgid ""
"**When to use:** - Large datasets from scientific databases - Complex "
"research results and literature - Long-form tool outputs that exceed "
"memory limits - When you need quick insights from detailed data"
msgstr ""
"**使用场景：**  \n"
"- 来自科学数据库的大型数据集  \n"
"- 复杂的研究结果和文献  \n"
"- 超出内存限制的长格式工具输出  \n"
"- 需要从详细数据中快速获取洞见时"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:24 d9411e0d886247d0bd2cf52cddd7c373
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:26 07d6536a0903469ea6dda86b91f6c92a
msgid "**Simple Usage**"
msgstr "**简单用法**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:48 542a05b1a3424ad29d085813d460b22f
msgid "**Advanced Configuration**"
msgstr "**高级配置**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:78 b24b3e0c95a7406e8db607dbd92a425c
msgid "Configuration Options"
msgstr "配置选项"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:80 3df55ab204bf4d2e8edc8fc82f4066ca
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Chunk Size** - Controls the size of chunks for processing - Default: "
"30000 characters - Range: 10000-50000 characters recommended for optimal "
"performance"
msgstr "**块大小** - 控制处理块的大小 - 默认值：32000 字符 - 建议范围：1000-5000 字符"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:85 bf6f7af08fb2497a89505056d999c230
msgid ""
"**Focus Areas** - Specifies what to focus on during summarization - "
"Default: \"key_findings_and_results\""
msgstr "**关注重点** - 指定摘要时应关注的内容 - 默认值：\"key_findings_and_results\""

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:89 364ff57562044b9b9ad44a106454b37c
msgid ""
"**Maximum Summary Length** - Limits the length of the final summary - "
"Default: 3000 characters"
msgstr "**最大摘要长度** - 限制最终摘要的长度 - 默认值：3000 字符"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:93 663605edd6e24c23844c3eba275973ac
msgid "**Excluding Tools**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:95 5c99e4fe7cc64dc29e6c53b37c003cc6
msgid "Use `exclude_tools` to prevent specific tools from being summarized:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:108
#: 79ccef6e38c1495ba0c3db508914eb5a
msgid ""
"This is particularly useful for excluding tool discovery tools that "
"shouldn't be processed by hooks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:110
#: d474180ff7e24821b6aed33638fbbd24
msgid "**Focus Areas Options**"
msgstr "**关注领域选项**"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:112
#: 1ebef84a6fb4402f82ce0d5a2bf539c7
msgid ""
"General Focus Areas: - `key_findings_and_results`: General key findings "
"and results - `consolidate_and_prioritize`: Merging multiple summaries - "
"`technical_details`: Technical specifications and details - "
"`main_conclusions`: Main conclusions and outcomes"
msgstr ""
"总体关注领域：  \n"
"- `key_findings_and_results`：主要发现和结果  \n"
"- `consolidate_and_prioritize`：合并多个摘要并优先排序  \n"
"- `technical_details`：技术规格和细节  \n"
"- `main_conclusions`：主要结论和成果"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:118
#: d31ce3f0c2854a36a26b774424efbf1e
msgid ""
"Domain-Specific Focus Areas: - `protein_function_and_structure`: Protein-"
"specific information - `compound_properties_and_activity`: Chemical "
"compound data - `key_findings_and_relevance`: Literature search results -"
" `clinical_significance_and_drug_interactions`: Clinical data - "
"`methodology_and_results`: Research methodology and findings"
msgstr ""
"领域特定关注点：  \n"
"- `protein_function_and_structure`：蛋白质相关信息  \n"
"- `compound_properties_and_activity`：化合物性质及活性数据  \n"
"- `key_findings_and_relevance`：文献检索结果  \n"
"- `clinical_significance_and_drug_interactions`：临床意义及药物相互作用  \n"
"- `methodology_and_results`：研究方法及结果"

