#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:228
#: 3e3813376195479aa0560b46861b2a3d
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:230
#: b9e848178fbb4939b8a61ea6386ddb3b
msgid ""
"**Summarization Not Triggering** - Check threshold settings: Ensure "
"output exceeds threshold - Verify hook is enabled: Check `enabled` field "
"- Confirm tool name matching: Ensure exact tool name match - Review "
"conditions: Check all condition parameters"
msgstr ""
"**摘要未触发** - 检查阈值设置：确保输出超过阈值 - 验证钩子是否启用：检查 `enabled` 字段 - "
"确认工具名称匹配：确保工具名称完全匹配 - 审查条件：检查所有条件参数"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:236
#: 5f9c468149da4390a0f4bad38c495340
msgid ""
"**Poor Summarization Quality** - Adjust focus areas: Use more specific "
"focus areas - Modify chunk size: Smaller chunks may provide better "
"context - Increase max summary length: Allow more detailed summaries - "
"Check query context: Ensure original query is captured"
msgstr ""
"**摘要质量差** - 调整关注区域：使用更具体的关注区域 - 修改分块大小：较小的分块可能提供更好的上下文 - "
"增加最大摘要长度：允许更详细的摘要 - 检查查询上下文：确保捕捉到原始查询"

#: ../../guide/hooks/summarization_hook.rst:242
#: c2d10d6e701e47b0b615fc20c23a02a7
msgid ""
"**Performance Issues** - Increase thresholds: Process fewer outputs - "
"Optimize chunk sizes: Balance processing time and quality - Use tool-"
"specific hooks: More efficient than global hooks - Enable caching: Reduce"
" redundant processing"
msgstr ""
"**性能问题**  \n"
"- 提高阈值：减少处理的输出数量  \n"
"- 优化分块大小：平衡处理时间与质量  \n"
"- 使用特定工具钩子：比全局钩子更高效  \n"
"- 启用缓存：减少重复处理"

